WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.271
Localazy is a hosted platform
for keyed files in dozens of

2
00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:06.952
formats, with AI and
human translation.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.645
General Translation translates
your components and files in

4
00:00:10.645 --> 00:00:12.583
your build, without keys.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.493
Its CLI uploads and
downloads keys in CI,

6
00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:20.963
and it delivers through
a CDN and mobile updates.

7
00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:23.348
Plans scale by source keys,

8
00:00:23.348 --> 00:00:24.694
with unlimited seats.

9
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.891
With General Translation,

10
00:00:26.891 --> 00:00:29.225
copy stays in &lt;T&gt; or your files,

11
00:00:29.225 --> 00:00:32.463
and npx gt translate
runs in your build.

12
00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:34.848
Reviewers edit in the Dashboard,

13
00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:37.541
and billing follows usage
instead of key counts.

14
00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:40.796
Your team now ships
Japanese with each release.
